According to Einstein’s photoelectric equation

$K_{max}$ = h$\nu$ – h$\nu$_{0}

Since $K_{max}$ is +ve, the photoelectric emission occurs only if

h$\nu >$ h$\nu$_{0} or $\nu > \nu$_{0}

